    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhangi kūlwa ng'wa Gogi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūnizīīla hangī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wana wa munhū, ng'hangīlage ū Gogi ū wa sī ya Magogi, ū nsugi ntaale wa Mesheki na Tubali; hangaga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūlīng'wīla, Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Nalī na wilwisha nang'ho Gogi, bebe nsugi wa Mesheki na Tubali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūkūhīnjūūla hūna nakūgwashe malobo ū mu saya jako, nakūfunye nī libità lyako pyī ī lyose, nī falasa jalyo, na a badamhīji ba falasa na shilanga shabo; n'ibità itaale lībūūkije mūda nhaale na ndo, pye a bose bakūhubengaga shū jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būajemi, Kushi na Puti bakūbiza hamò nabo, bose pye bakūbiza na mūda jabo na mahima ga chūma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī Gomeli na a mabità gayo, na Beti-togama kūfuma sukuma ya kūle na a mabità gayo pye a gose; mahanga mingī ayo galī kū lwande lwako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malīīlaga, nīyo wikale nzūgūlūmatū ū bebe na a mabità ayo wibilingīlile; hama wikale ūgalang'hanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya shikū ningī ūkūlagījiwa kūdima shilanga; kū myaka ya kū būtongi ūkūja kūdumīla sī īyo yapīlile kūfuma mu būlūgū, sī īyo banhū bayo baabibilingilwe kūfuma mu mahanga mingī, biza kū ngūlū ja Isilaeli ījo jalī jalekwa dalali ikanza ilīhu. A banhū benabo benhilwe kūfuma kū mahanga, ī haha pye a bose bakwikalaga mu mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe na a mabità gako, na mahanga mingī gakūbiza hamò nang'ho, mukūlinha mujile mukūfeefenyaga gītī nyaga ntaale; ī sī mukwīkundīkīja gītī ilunde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo gakūkwizīīla maganiko ū mu ng'holò yako, hūnū ūkūhela mhayo mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkwiwīla, “Nakūjūsakamīla sī ya magūngūli gatapīndīlījiwe ndugu; nadumīle banhū abo batī na sha kūbibakīja, pye batī na magoobe ga mibita, nūūlū batī na būgong'ho bo kūpagīgīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūja nakūsolaga shikolo na kūbataaja bo nguzu, ū nkono gwane nakūgūgalūkīja ū kū misaka īyo yapandīkile mo bikaji haha, banhū abo bizile kūfuma kū mahanga, bizile kwikala ha gatī ya sī bibilinga henaho; basabi ba mitugo nī shikolo ī shingī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana Sheba na Dedani na a basūlūja ba Talishishi na a magūngūli gaamo pye a gose bakūkūwīla, “Wizile kūsola shikolo bo nguzu? Wabilingile mabità gako kwiza kūtaaja shikolo, kūbūūcha feza na zahabu, kūjaana mitugo na sabo jingī, na kūdima shikolo shingī bo nguzu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ng'wana wa munhū, hangaga ūng'wīle ū Gogi, Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, “Ū lūshikū lwa banhū bane a Baisilaeli kwandya kwikala mu mhola, ūtūbabyūlīla miso? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkwiza kūfuma ū kū wikalo wako, ī sukuma ya kūle; na mahanga gangī mingī gakūbiza galī hamò nang'ho, pye badamhīji ba falasa. Līkūbiza ibità itaale na lya nguzu ningī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe Gogi ūkūbahoolekela a banhū bane a Baisilaeli, ūbize gīt'ilunde kūkundīkīja sī. Ū mu shikū ja kū būtongi, nakūkwenha wize kwīdumīla ī sī yane, a mahanga ganideebe kūlwa kūboolecha ū wela bone mu nzīla yako, nago galībona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Ūtī bebe ūyo naakūhaya kwīngīīla shikū ja kale mu nzīla ya batūmami bane a bahangi ba Isilaeli? Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo baahanga no myaka na myaka, gīkī nakwizūkwenha ūbadumīle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa kwīdumīla ī sī ya Isilaeli ū Gogi, ū būpelanu bone būkūbaka gītī moto; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nalīhaya mu būpelanu bo wilu bone gīkī, ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo kūkūbiza ho kūtingina kūtaale ū mu sī ya Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ndīlo ja mu nyanza nī noni ja kūlala, pyī nī shiinū ja mu masaka; nī shiseeng'wa pyī īsho shikayeelaga higūlya ya sī, na a banhū pye abo balī mu sī bakūdetema ū kū būtongi wane. Ī ngūlū jikūsalingūlwa, na a mang'ong'ho gakūsambaajiwa, na būlī ndugu īkūgwa hasī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūsamīlīja būlūgū kūlwa ng'wa Gogi būlī kwene ū kū ngūlū jane, alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU; pye bakwiyūbūkīla, būlī munhū na g'wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūngwisīja nsango ū wei na a mabità gakwe, na a mahanga pye ayo galī hamò nang'hwe; nsango gwa mabūsaatu n'icha, nakūng'wenhela na mbula nhaale ya malambo, na ya mawe, na moto gwa kūbaka na būgota wa shibiliti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko nakūbūkumūcha ū būtaale bone, nū wela bone, nakwiyoolecha hape kū būtongi bo mahanga mingī. Hūna bakūdeeba gīkī ū nene nalī SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
